#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:5
msgid "External Replica Routing"
msgstr "外部副本路由"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:7
msgid ""
"The ``external`` strategy delegates replica selection to an operator-run "
"HTTP service after AIBrix has resolved the requested model and filtered "
"unsafe replicas. It does not perform semantic or cross-model routing, and"
" it never sends prompts, request bodies, credentials, arbitrary client "
"headers, or pod addresses."
msgstr ""
"AIBrix 解析请求的模型并过滤不安全的副本后，``external`` 策略会将副本选择委托给由"
"运维人员运行的 HTTP 服务。该策略不执行语义路由或跨模型路由，也绝不会发送提示词、"
"请求正文、凭据、任意客户端标头或 Pod 地址。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:13
msgid ""
"The protocol is alpha. Download the normative :download:`OpenAPI 3.1 "
"contract <../_static/openapi/external-replica-selection-v1alpha1.yaml>`."
msgstr ""
"该协议处于 alpha 阶段。请下载规范性 :download:`OpenAPI 3.1 合约 "
"<../_static/openapi/external-replica-selection-v1alpha1.yaml>`。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:17
msgid "Current scope: single-target routing"
msgstr "当前范围：单目标路由"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:19
msgid ""
"The ``routing.aibrix.ai/v1alpha1`` contract selects exactly one target "
"Pod and port per invocation. A candidate may expose a ``prefill`` or "
"``decode`` role as an allowlisted attribute, but that attribute is only "
"an input to the single-target decision. The ``external`` strategy does "
"not select a P/D pair, run the prefill leg, transfer KV state, align a "
"role set, or dispatch the decode leg. Use the built-in ``pd`` strategy "
"for the current P/D disaggregation flow; external control of that paired "
"workflow is future scope."
msgstr ""
"``routing.aibrix.ai/v1alpha1`` 合约每次调用只选择一个目标 Pod 和端口。候选项可将 "
"``prefill`` 或 ``decode`` 角色作为允许列表中的属性公开，但该属性仅作为单目标决策"
"的输入。``external`` 策略不会选择 P/D 对、运行预填充阶段、传输 KV 状态、对齐角色集"
"或分派解码阶段。当前的 P/D 分离流程请使用内置 ``pd`` 策略；由外部控制这一配对工作流"
"属于未来范围。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:28
msgid "Request flow"
msgstr "请求流程"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:30
msgid ""
"The external decision service participates only in replica selection. "
"Gateway retains candidate discovery and filtering, validates the returned"
" target, performs final admission and accounting, and returns the "
"selected target to Envoy. Inference traffic continues to flow directly "
"between Envoy and the selected inference Pod."
msgstr ""
"外部决策服务仅参与副本选择。Gateway 仍负责候选项发现和过滤、验证返回的目标、执行"
"最终准入和计量，并将选中的目标返回给 Envoy。推理流量仍直接在 Envoy 与选中的推理 "
"Pod 之间流动。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:61
msgid "Candidate discovery"
msgstr "候选项发现"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:63
msgid ""
"Gateway resolves the model from the inference request, then reads "
"candidate Pods from its Kubernetes informer-backed cache. Pods are "
"indexed by the AIBrix model label or annotation, and warm-pool Pods are "
"also indexed through their ModelClaim bindings. Gateway then applies "
"readiness, routability, ``external-filter``, replica-inflight and "
"configured load filters before the external router receives the snapshot."
msgstr ""
"Gateway 从推理请求中解析模型，然后从由 Kubernetes informer 支持的缓存中读取候选 "
"Pod。Pod 按 AIBrix 模型标签或注解建立索引，热池 Pod 还会通过其 ModelClaim 绑定建立"
"索引。在外部路由器收到快照前，Gateway 随后会应用就绪性、可路由性、``external-filter``、"
"副本在途请求数和已配置的负载过滤器。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:70
msgid ""
"Backend candidate discovery does not read Kubernetes Service "
"``Endpoints``/``EndpointSlice`` objects. Gateway retains each candidate "
"Pod and resolves its Pod IP and model-specific serving port locally; a "
"ModelClaim port of zero remains non-routable. The operator-configured "
"external decision URL may itself point to a Kubernetes Service, as in the"
" sample, but that Service is the decision-service transport and is not "
"the source of backend candidates."
msgstr ""
"后端候选项发现不会读取 Kubernetes Service 的 ``Endpoints``/``EndpointSlice`` 对象。"
"Gateway 保留每个候选 Pod，并在本地解析其 Pod IP 和特定于模型的服务端口；端口为零的 "
"ModelClaim 仍不可路由。运维人员配置的外部决策 URL 本身可以像示例中一样指向某个 "
"Kubernetes Service，但该 Service 是决策服务的传输通道，而非后端候选项的来源。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:78
msgid "Policy modes"
msgstr "策略模式"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:80
msgid ""
"``Advisory`` optimizes placement. A single candidate with one port keeps "
"the local fast path. ``Selected`` uses the validated target and "
"``NoDecision`` runs the configured fallback. ``Denied`` is invalid in "
"this mode."
msgstr ""
"``Advisory`` 用于优化放置。仅有一个端口的单个候选项继续使用本地快速路径。"
"``Selected`` 使用已验证的目标，``NoDecision`` 运行已配置的回退路由。``Denied`` 在此模式"
"下无效。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:84
msgid ""
"``Authoritative`` enforces business or compliance policy. It calls the "
"service even for one candidate. ``Denied`` returns an AIBrix-owned HTTP "
"403 response with code ``external_policy_denied`` and never reaches an "
"inference backend. Authoritative requires ``FailClosed``; ``NoDecision`` "
"is invalid."
msgstr ""
"``Authoritative`` 强制执行业务或合规策略。即使只有一个候选项，它也会调用服务。"
"``Denied`` 返回由 AIBrix 生成、代码为 ``external_policy_denied`` 的 HTTP 403 响应，且"
"绝不会到达推理后端。Authoritative 要求使用 ``FailClosed``；``NoDecision`` 无效。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:89
msgid ""
"System failures follow the explicit failure mode. ``FailOpen`` invokes "
"the configured local fallback. ``FailClosed`` returns HTTP 503 with code "
"``external_router_unavailable``. Caller cancellation never falls back. "
"The external reason is diagnostic and is never copied to the client "
"response."
msgstr ""
"系统故障遵循显式配置的故障模式。``FailOpen`` 调用已配置的本地回退路由。``FailClosed`` "
"返回代码为 ``external_router_unavailable`` 的 HTTP 503 响应。调用方取消请求时绝不回退。"
"外部原因仅用于诊断，绝不会复制到客户端响应中。"

