#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:172
msgid ""
"The configured endpoint is the complete operation URL; Gateway does not "
"append a path. ``X-Request-Id`` equals ``metadata.requestId``. Gateway "
"also propagates a valid current W3C ``traceparent`` when available and "
"sends ``Authorization: Bearer <token>`` only when "
"``AIBRIX_EXTERNAL_ROUTER_AUTH_TOKEN_FILE`` is set. It never forwards the "
"inference client's authorization or arbitrary headers."
msgstr ""
"配置的端点是完整的操作 URL；Gateway 不会追加路径。``X-Request-Id`` 等于 "
"``metadata.requestId``。如果存在有效的当前 W3C ``traceparent``，Gateway 也会传播它，"
"并且仅在设置 ``AIBRIX_EXTERNAL_ROUTER_AUTH_TOKEN_FILE`` 时发送 ``Authorization: Bearer "
"<token>``。它绝不会转发推理客户端的授权信息或任意标头。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:178
msgid ""
"A request contains sorted candidate IDs and ports. Optional attributes "
"and metrics are omitted when they are not configured or available, never "
"encoded as ``null``."
msgstr ""
"请求包含已排序的候选项 ID 和端口。未配置或不可用的可选属性和指标会被省略，绝不会编码"
"为 ``null``。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:207
msgid "Request fields have these meanings:"
msgstr "请求字段的含义如下："

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:209
msgid ""
"``apiVersion`` and ``kind`` are fixed to ``routing.aibrix.ai/v1alpha1`` "
"and ``ReplicaSelectionRequest``."
msgstr "``apiVersion`` 和 ``kind`` 固定为 ``routing.aibrix.ai/v1alpha1`` 和 ``ReplicaSelectionRequest``。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:211
msgid ""
"``metadata.requestId`` is a non-empty correlation ID of at most 256 UTF-8"
" bytes. The response must echo it exactly."
msgstr ""
"``metadata.requestId`` 是非空的关联 ID，长度不超过 256 个 UTF-8 字节。响应必须原样"
"回显该 ID。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:213
msgid ""
"``spec.model`` is the model already resolved by Gateway. The service "
"cannot change it."
msgstr "``spec.model`` 是 Gateway 已解析的模型。服务不能更改它。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:215
msgid ""
"``spec.policyMode`` is the process-configured ``Advisory`` or "
"``Authoritative`` mode."
msgstr "``spec.policyMode`` 是进程所配置的 ``Advisory`` 或 ``Authoritative`` 模式。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:217
msgid ""
"``spec.policyContext.attributes`` contains at most 32 trusted, operator-"
"allowlisted values. Raw client headers do not populate it."
msgstr ""
"``spec.policyContext.attributes`` 最多包含 32 个可信且经运维人员列入允许列表的值。原始"
"客户端标头不会填充此字段。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:219
msgid ""
"``spec.candidates`` is a non-empty request-local snapshot sorted by "
"``namespace/pod-name``. Candidate order has no preference semantics."
msgstr ""
"``spec.candidates`` 是按 ``namespace/pod-name`` 排序的非空请求本地快照。候选项顺序"
"不表示任何偏好。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:221
msgid ""
"``candidates[].id`` is the exact ``namespace/pod-name`` identity that a "
"response may select. ``ports`` is the sorted, unique set of locally "
"routable ports in the range 1-65535."
msgstr ""
"``candidates[].id`` 是响应可以选择的精确 ``namespace/pod-name`` 标识。``ports`` 是"
"经过排序、去重且可在本地路由的端口集合，范围为 1-65535。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:224
msgid ""
"``candidates[].attributes`` contains only pod-label keys in "
"``AIBRIX_EXTERNAL_ROUTER_CANDIDATE_ATTRIBUTES``."
msgstr ""
"``candidates[].attributes`` 仅包含 ``AIBRIX_EXTERNAL_ROUTER_CANDIDATE_ATTRIBUTES`` "
"中的 Pod 标签键。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:227
msgid ""
"Candidate metrics are fixed typed fields selected through "
"``AIBRIX_EXTERNAL_ROUTER_CANDIDATE_METRICS``. They are observational "
"cache snapshots, not reservations or a linearizable load view:"
msgstr ""
"候选项指标是通过 ``AIBRIX_EXTERNAL_ROUTER_CANDIDATE_METRICS`` 选择的固定类型字段。它们"
"是观测性的缓存快照，而不是资源预留或可线性化的负载视图："

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:231
msgid ""
"``runningRequests`` is a non-negative, pod-wide live count from one "
"batched Gateway cache read. It is not a per-port or per-rank value."
msgstr ""
"``runningRequests`` 是通过一次 Gateway 缓存批量读取获得的非负 Pod 级实时计数，并非"
"按端口或按 rank 统计的值。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:233
msgid ""
"``engineUtilization`` is a finite ratio in ``[0,1]`` from the requested "
"model's cached engine metric. It is currently populated only for engines "
"that expose the mapped metric, including xLLM; otherwise it is omitted."
msgstr ""
"``engineUtilization`` 是从所请求模型的缓存引擎指标获取的 ``[0,1]`` 范围内有限比率。"
"目前仅对公开相应映射指标的引擎（包括 xLLM）填充该字段；否则省略。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:236
msgid ""
"``kvCacheUsage`` is a finite ratio in ``[0,1]`` from cached "
"``KVCacheUsagePerc``; ``1.0`` means full."
msgstr ""
"``kvCacheUsage`` 是从缓存的 ``KVCacheUsagePerc`` 获取的 ``[0,1]`` 范围内有限比率；"
"``1.0`` 表示已满。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:239
msgid ""
"Missing, non-finite, negative, or above-one optional metric values are "
"omitted individually without failing routing. Gateway does not scrape "
"engines or make a per-candidate network call to populate them."
msgstr ""
"缺失、非有限、负数或大于一的可选指标值会分别被省略，而不会导致路由失败。Gateway "
"不会抓取引擎指标，也不会为填充这些值而逐个候选项发起网络调用。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:243
msgid ""
"A selected response must echo the request ID. Gateway rejects candidates "
"and ports that were not present in the exact request."
msgstr "选中目标的响应必须回显请求 ID。Gateway 会拒绝未在该请求中出现的候选项和端口。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:258
msgid ""
"``target.id`` must occur in the exact candidate snapshot. ``target.port``"
" must belong to that candidate; it may be omitted only when the candidate"
" advertised exactly one port. The service cannot return an address or "
"URL."
msgstr ""
"``target.id`` 必须存在于该候选项快照中。``target.port`` 必须属于该候选项；仅当候选项"
"恰好公布一个端口时才可省略。服务不能返回地址或 URL。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:262
msgid ""
"``NoDecision`` is valid only in Advisory mode and runs the configured "
"fallback:"
msgstr "``NoDecision`` 仅在 Advisory 模式下有效，并运行已配置的回退路由："

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:276
msgid ""
"``Denied`` is valid only in Authoritative mode and returns the fixed "
"Gateway HTTP 403 response without reaching a backend:"
msgstr "``Denied`` 仅在 Authoritative 模式下有效，并返回固定的 Gateway HTTP 403 响应，而不会到达后端："

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:294
msgid ""
"``NoDecision`` and ``Denied`` omit ``target``. ``decisionId`` and "
"``reason`` are optional strings of at most 256 UTF-8 bytes; the external "
"reason is never copied to the inference client response."
msgstr ""
"``NoDecision`` 和 ``Denied`` 省略 ``target``。``decisionId`` 和 ``reason`` 是长度"
"不超过 256 个 UTF-8 字节的可选字符串；外部原因绝不会复制到推理客户端响应中。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:298
msgid ""
"Only HTTP 200 with the exact protocol media type is a decision. Gateway "
"rejects empty bodies, malformed JSON, duplicate object members, trailing "
"JSON values, missing or null required fields, mismatched request IDs, "
"illegal decisions, and targets outside the request snapshot. Unknown "
"response fields are ignored for additive alpha evolution. Redirects, "
"compression, and automatic retries are disabled."
msgstr ""
"只有使用准确协议媒体类型的 HTTP 200 响应才算作决策。Gateway 会拒绝空正文、格式错误"
"的 JSON、重复的对象成员、尾随 JSON 值、缺失或为 null 的必填字段、不匹配的请求 ID、"
"非法决策以及请求快照之外的目标。为支持 alpha 阶段的增量演进，未知响应字段会被忽略。"
"重定向、压缩和自动重试均被禁用。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:306
msgid "Security and operations"
msgstr "安全与运维"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:308
msgid ""
"The endpoint URL and credentials are process-controlled and cannot be "
"supplied or overridden by a client. The ``external`` strategy still "
"participates in the normal routing-strategy resolution order, including "
"the generic ``routing-strategy`` request header unless an operator locks "
"or otherwise controls strategy selection. Do not use that header as an "
"authorization boundary."
msgstr ""
"端点 URL 和凭据由进程控制，客户端无法提供或覆盖。除非运维人员锁定或以其他方式控制"
"策略选择，否则 ``external`` 策略仍参与正常的路由策略解析顺序，包括通用的 "
"``routing-strategy`` 请求标头。请勿将该标头用作授权边界。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:315
msgid ""
"Use a Kubernetes Service, NetworkPolicy, least-privilege bearer token, "
"and HTTPS where required. The decision service must coordinate its own "
"state across replicas. Gateway candidate membership, address resolution, "
"final admission and request accounting remain local. Bulkheads and "
"circuit breakers are deliberately process-local to each Gateway replica."
msgstr ""
"根据需要使用 Kubernetes Service、NetworkPolicy、最小权限 bearer token 和 HTTPS。"
"决策服务必须自行协调各副本间的状态。Gateway 的候选项成员关系、地址解析、最终准入和"
"请求计量仍在本地完成。舱壁和熔断器特意保持为每个 Gateway 副本的进程本地机制。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:321
msgid "Monitor these low-cardinality metrics:"
msgstr "监控以下低基数指标："

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:323
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``aibrix_gateway_external_router_requests_total{outcome}``"
msgstr "``aibrix_gateway_external_router_requests_total{outcome}``"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:324
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``aibrix_gateway_external_router_fallback_total{reason}``"
msgstr "``aibrix_gateway_external_router_fallback_total{reason}``"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:325
msgid "``aibrix_gateway_external_router_duration_seconds``"
msgstr "``aibrix_gateway_external_router_duration_seconds``"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:326
msgid "``aibrix_gateway_external_router_inflight``"
msgstr "``aibrix_gateway_external_router_inflight``"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:327
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``aibrix_gateway_external_router_circuit_state{state}``"
msgstr "``aibrix_gateway_external_router_circuit_state{state}``"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:329
msgid ""
"The fallback counter records each invocation attempt before the local "
"router runs, so both successful and failed fallbacks are visible."
msgstr ""
"回退计数器会在本地路由器运行前记录每次调用尝试，因此成功和失败的回退均可观测。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:332
msgid ""
"Start with an Advisory canary, compare fallback and latency rates, then "
"move to Authoritative only after denial and service-availability tests "
"pass. Roll back by removing ``external`` from routing selection or "
"unsetting the endpoint and restarting Gateway."
msgstr ""
"先从 Advisory 金丝雀部署开始，比较回退率和延迟率；仅在拒绝与服务可用性测试通过后，"
"再迁移到 Authoritative。回滚时，可从路由选择中移除 ``external``，或取消设置端点并"
"重启 Gateway。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:338
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:340
msgid ""
"HTTP 403 with ``external_policy_denied`` is a valid Authoritative denial,"
" not an external-service outage."
msgstr ""
"带有 ``external_policy_denied`` 的 HTTP 403 是有效的 Authoritative 拒绝，并非外部服务"
"中断。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:342
msgid ""
"HTTP 503 with ``external_router_unavailable`` means FailClosed handled a "
"system or protocol failure. Check the bounded Gateway error log, external"
" request and fallback counters, latency, and circuit state."
msgstr ""
"带有 ``external_router_unavailable`` 的 HTTP 503 表示 FailClosed 处理了系统或协议"
"故障。请检查长度受限的 Gateway 错误日志、外部请求及回退计数器、延迟和熔断器状态。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:345
msgid ""
"If an allowlisted attribute or metric is absent, verify the environment "
"allowlist and its trusted/cache data source. Absence does not fail "
"routing."
msgstr ""
"如果允许列表中的属性或指标缺失，请验证环境允许列表及其可信/缓存数据源。缺失不会导致"
"路由失败。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:347
msgid ""
"Repeated ``open`` circuit state usually indicates transport, timeout, "
"non-200, media-type, JSON, request-ID, or target-validation failures."
msgstr ""
"熔断器反复处于 ``open`` 状态通常表示传输、超时、非 200 响应、媒体类型、JSON、请求 "
"ID 或目标验证失败。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:349
msgid ""
"A decision service must return the candidate ID exactly as supplied, "
"including namespace, and must select only an advertised port."
msgstr "决策服务必须原样返回所提供的候选项 ID（包括命名空间），且只能选择已公布的端口。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:353
msgid "Sample"
msgstr "示例"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/external-replica-routing.rst:355
msgid ""
"See the runnable sample under ``samples/external-replica-router/`` for "
"preferred-zone and premium-accelerator rules with deterministic tie-"
"breaking. Trusted policy attributes must be populated by validated in-"
"process code; do not copy raw tenant or authorization headers into them."
msgstr ""
"请参阅 ``samples/external-replica-router/`` 下可运行的示例，其中包含采用确定性决胜规则"
"的首选可用区和高端加速器规则。可信策略属性必须由经过验证的进程内代码填充；请勿将原始"
"租户或授权标头复制到其中。"
